#question(title: [Positive functions])[
  #set text(size: 13pt)

  - Let $f$ be continuous on $[a, oo)$. Let
    $display(A = integral_a^oo f(x) d x)$

    Then $A$ may be
    $display(cases(" convergent (a number) ", " divergent " cases(" to " oo, " to " - oo, " “oscillating”")))$
  - Assume
    $display(forall x >= a comma f(x) >= 0)$.
    #v(0.2cm)

    #boxed[$display("Which of the four options are still possible? ")$]
  - Assume
    $display(exists M >= a comma " s.t. " forall x >= M comma f(x) >= 0)$.
    #v(0.2cm)

    #boxed[$display("Which of the four options are still possible? ")$]
]
